2 types of kubernetes deployment
1)from scratch
2)using Kube ADM tool


1)setup etcd from scratch
if you setup your cluster from scratch, then you deploy etcd by download etcd binaries yourself and configuring etcd as server in master node

wget -q --https-only \
etcd.service ;there will be one address(url) where your etcd listens, this url should be configured in kube api server when it tries to reach etcd server

2)configuraing etcd as clusters for HA in kubernetes

3)setup using Kube ADM
kube ADM will deploy etcd server for you as a pod in the kube system namespace
you can explore etcd database using etcd utility within this pod(commands)

4)in a HA environment you'll have mutiples master nodes in your cluster
then you'll have multiple etcd servers spread across master nodes



























